\pard\b\fs20 Sacred Hills\b0\par
\fs16\par
Let the fight begin! A fight over the land of the Sacred Hills, proposed by the Council of Cra-Kla-Zoth. All sorts of paladins of the country have been quarreling over this special land for decades. The solution: a fight of everyone involved, in the land, for the land.\par
In this scenario, brave paladins fight each other in a rugged landscape.\par
For every kill you get some money, which you can then put to good use in the tent. With a bit of luck, killed enemies also leave behind a useful object or two.\par
The goal is frags; the first player can set their limit at the start of the round.\par
